content:
{title: Polo En Dala Jo Moloyo Lweny}

{comment: Verse 1}
Pole end ala jo moloyo lweny piny,
Kedi ilo wasiki mondo idhi idonjie polo,
En dalagi jawar
En dalagi jawar 

{comment: Verse 2}
Polo jonabi gi joote duto okedone,
Kedi ilo wasiki mondo idhi idonji;
E dala no moyaw gi remo
E dala no moyaw gi remo

{comment: Verse 3}
Ngima, Johana jabatiso bende otho ne ngima,
To Yesu ma jawarwa otho e yath ne ngima;
Jo mathuondi ema dhi
Jo mathuondi ema dhi

{comment: Verse 4}
Biuru un joma dwara dhi e polo
Ngima oyaw ne joma oloyo lwenje mudho,
Ginindi Jerusalem manyien
Ginindi Jerusalem manyien

{comment: Verse 5}
Nonri, kidwaro dhiyo donjo e ngima cha,
Mondo ing~e nengo ma Yesu noweyo ni Joge,
Hera gi ng`uono kod adiera
Hera gi ng`uono kod adiera
